  "job_B16.10.8_20251003_114351": {
    "chunk_text": "ix manegum Of sancto Siluestre \u00feam wur\u00f0fullan papan. Of sancto Gregorie. Of sancto Hieronime \u00feam \u00e6\u00feelan lareowe, se\u00fee betwix o\u00f0rum m\u00e6nigfealdum bocum, \u00fee he gedihte, Of reliquion sanctus Augustines \u00fe\u00e6s wisan & \u00fe\u00e6s snoteran biscopes, se gedihte an \u00feusend boca Criste Of sancte Germane \u00feam apostolican were, \u00fee on \u00feisum lande & eac on o\u00f0rum landum gehw\u00e6r Of sanctus Basilius to\u00f0e & of his biscopstafe. Of sanctus Euurties lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes, \u00feam atiwde dextera Dei, \u00fe\u00e6t is Godes swi\u00f0re, \u00fea\u00f0e he Of sanctus Audoenes reliquion. Of sancte Medardes banum \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes. Of sancto Crispino. Of sancte Maurilie \u00feam biscope. Of sancto Galle \u00feam biscope. Of sancto Lupo \u00f0am biscope. Of sancte Benedicte \u00feam halgan abbude. Of sancte Remigies reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s deorwir\u00f0an biscopes, \u00fee eall Francrice to Cristes geleafan gebigde, Of sancte Anianes lichaman \u00fe\u00e6s halgan biscopes. Of sancte Maximines lichaman confessoris. Of sanctus Wulframnes reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes. Of sancto Crispo. Of sanctus Nicolaus reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s arf\u00e6stan & \u00fe\u00e6s benty\u00f0an biscopes, \u00fee \u00feurh Godes mihte manege Of sancte Petroces banum & of his fexe & of his cla\u00f0on. Of sancte Winwaloe \u00feam abbode. Of sancte Winarde \u00feam biscope. Of sancte Wernoco. Of sancte Wigenoce. Of sancte Tutes h\u00e6ron \u00f0\u00e6s biscopes. Of sanctus Odones reliquion \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran biscopes. Sancte Iuuenales earm \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes. Of sancte Dyon",
